<title>KUWAIT: Britain's Portillo in Kuwait for brief visit.</title>
<headline>Britain's Portillo in Kuwait for brief visit.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Defence Secretary Michael Portillo arrived in Kuwait late on Sunday for a brief visit after concluding an $825 million arms deal in neighbouring Qatar.</p>
<p>British diplomats said on Monday Portillo, who has been promoting British arms sales to Gulf Arab states, was on a brief routine visit to Kuwait which also has pending lucrative deals for military hardware.</p>
<p>In Qatar he secured the deal for armoured personnel carriers, patrol boats, missiles and Hawk trainer aircraft.</p>
</text>
